<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - Pharos</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://haidang.space/privacy">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f8f9fa;
            --text-color: #212529;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --accent-color: #0d6efd;
            --border-color: #e9ecef;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 24px 16px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .effective-date {
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-top: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 6px;
        }

        p, li {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        a {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .contact-box {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="effective-date">Last updated: September 24, 2026</div>

        <p>
            This Privacy Policy applies to all mobile games and applications (collectively, the "Apps") developed and published by <strong>Pharos</strong> ("we", "us", or "our") on the Google Play Store and other mobile app platforms.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            We do not collect, request, or store any personally identifiable information (such as your real name, physical address, or phone number).
        </p>
        <p>
            Our Apps may integrate third-party services (such as ad networks and analytics platforms) that automatically collect non-personal device information to function properly, including:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Device identifiers (such as Google Advertising ID / GAID).</li>
            <li>Device characteristics (device model, operating system version, screen resolution, language).</li>
            <li>Broad location data (country or city level derived from IP address).</li>
            <li>In-game diagnostic, gameplay interaction, and crash logs.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
        <p>
            Our Apps may use third-party SDKs to display advertisements or monitor stability. These providers handle data according to their own privacy policies:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Google Play Services:</strong>
                <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Google AdMob:</strong>
                <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google AdMob Privacy Policy</a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Unity Ads / LevelPlay:</strong>
                <a href="https://unity.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unity Privacy Policy</a>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
            Our Apps store game settings (e.g., sound volume, haptic feedback toggles) and gameplay progress locally on your device. This data never leaves your device and is not sent to external servers.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
            Our Apps are intended for a general audience and are not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe any personal data from a child has been collected through a third-party SDK, please contact us immediately.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your Choices & Opting Out</h2>
        <p>
            You can manage or opt out of personalized advertisements at any time in your device settings:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>On Android: <strong>Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads</strong> &gt; select <strong>Delete advertising ID</strong> or <strong>Opt out of Ads Personalization</strong>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this policy periodically. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
            If you have any questions or feedback about our privacy practices, please contact:
        </p>
        <div class="contact-box">
            <strong>Developer:</strong> Pharos<br>
            <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:haidang.gamedev@gmail.com">haidang.gamedev@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
